Well, take care. Don't be overconfident, especially in the Planes. Don't
remove free action. Use conflict. Use levitation on the planes (air, fire
and water).

You have 4 scrolls of gold detection for the portals ? Or INT 20 to use
with the Orb ?

Go slowly and prepare everything before you wake the Wizard and then run
as fast as you can. Only carry what you need (no use for diamonds, you're
not hunting for score) and stay far from being burdened.

